//New Bows 
@128 = ~Corinth's Bow~ 
@129 = ~Though obviously well-used, someone has taken excellent care of this finely crafted bow. A small golden seal on one side appears to be a family crest.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +1

Combat abilities: 
– After scoring a critical hit, the wielder is affected by the Luck spell

THAC0: +3
Damage: +4
Speed Factor: 5
Proficiency Type: Longbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 17 Strength

Weight: 8~
@130 = ~Savage Bow~
@131 = ~This bow appears crudely made. The knotty length of wood has numerous stumps where twigs were pruned away, and living leaves still spring from it. In spite of its apparent poor quality, the bow has clearly been enhanced with nature magic. It is rumored the wild elves of the Chondalwood make good use of such weapons, especially against invading orcs and ogres.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Constitution: +1 (elves and half-elves)
- 3 shots per round
THAC0: +2
Damage: +2, +3 extra vs. orcs, half-orcs, and ogres
Speed Factor: 4
Proficiency Type: Shortbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 6 Strength

Weight: 2~
@2000 = ~Done and done.~
@2001 = ~12 pieces of ammunition, ready for use!~
@2002 = ~A fresh batch of ammunition ready.~
@2003 = ~There! Finished.~
@2004 = ~I'm about half-way through my supplies, <CHARNAME>.~
@2005 = ~Eugh, I might have pricked my finger. I'll slow down next time.~
@2006 = ~I've got enough for three more batches. Let's use them up wisely.~
@2007 = ~You should repay me with a nice pair of new boots for all this fletching. I'm kidding! Kind of.~
@2008 = ~Just a warning, I've only enough supplies for only one more quiver, then I'm all out.~
@2009 = ~That's the last of the supplies. Let's use these last ones well.~

@60000 = ~Isaac's Hunt~
@60001 = ~Isaac's Hunt

We've invited Isaac, a Planar Hunter seeking to hunt down a tiefling named Mavis. He seems honorable, though he also tried to kill us. It remains to be seen if he can be trusted.~ 
@60002 = ~Isaac's Hunt

Isaac mentioned how we can get started in his hunt for Mavis. He knows of two people who were last in contact with her, a mage named Yusmin who is staying in the Red Sheaf, and a merchant Avarn, who is staying in the Jovial Juggler. We should talk with one of them to find out where she is. Neither will cooperate with a planar hunter, so we should keep Isaac out of their sight when we speak to them.~
@60003 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Yusmin attacked us, refusing to give any information on Mavis's whereabouts.~
@60004 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Yusmin revealed to us a lead. An apprentice of Mavis's associate named Vern is waiting in Nashkel at the Belching Dragon Tavern for some spell components that Yusmin has no desire to deliver. We can track down Vern there and get answers on where Mavis may be.~
@60005 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Avarn saw we were with Isaac and refused to work with us.~
@60006 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Avarn revealed to us a lead. An apprentice of Mavis's associate named Vern is waiting in Nashkel for some gems that Avarn has no desire to deliver. We can track down Vern there and get answers on where Mavis may be.~
@60007 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Avarn attacked us, refusing to give any information on Mavis's whereabouts.~

@60008 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Isaac's hunt now turns to Baldur's Gate, where Caim's apprentice reports his master and Mavis are currently located, meeting with an Aasimar. He suggests we move there when we can and find some associates of his, who will be within the city.~

@60009 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Vern was slain. Isaac says the only hope he has left is to regroup with his associates, hoping they have some idea where the hunt can turn to next.~

@60010 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Fed up with our failures with his hunt for Mavis, Isaac has left the party.~

@60011 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Vern was slain. Fed up with our failures, we moved to finish our fight we started against one another.~

@60012 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Isaac met up with his fellow planar hunter's in Baldur's Gate, who informed him they seen the aasimar associate in the district, and advised checking the local inns. They suggested through her, dead or alive, we can learn where Mavis is.~

@60013 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

We told Isaac that his fellows were slain by us. Infuriated, he attacked us.~

@60014 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

Isaac learned that Mavis is around the temple in Beregost. He is eager to face off with her there.~

@60015 = ~Isaac's Hunt 

We finally came face to face with Mavis. But before Isaac could have his revenge, her cohort, Caim, teleported her and the gnome Arbex to somewhere unknown. We killed Caim, but he succeeded in making the hunt cold. For now, the pursuit of Mavis is at an end.~

